{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_086878beb276760d53017acaef7a876adbeb9a2921ede887a5300a48d305b0ee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_39396f377ac4057ffa1a38635afea88e85cc77b67a57cdbb8eb699f6c80afaa3"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"hcom trusts the local user account and ~/.hcom/config.toml and does not defend against another user on the same account or malware with filesystem access.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_25a9c90e97437eeace6057b4cf9eff9c1966c897b0083bc0d08e5d4a2f531c3a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_908f11bfe23a97d86abd6c6e89692ae5c74563ce23f8e5a2d07de14ccb56aee5","slc_93c78c089850c693fab2cc33a4215d235de06bc297971814ae310effad08b435","slc_c7f5bd0b43570f87312ec8c4e5e34d83c98699df98adccef888bdc0f2c66f4e1","slc_d8f6a0d432d27652fddd756d74fa3de0f3868050ed1256d6a1eba9daa2474426"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Bundled workflow scripts include `hcom run confess` (honesty self-eval with an independent calibrator and judge), `debate` (judge-coordinated rounds), and `fatcow` (headless file-reading agent); custom *.sh/*.py scripts in ~/.hcom/scripts/ are auto-discovered.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_29eea2d0b8fc172a40b75f106fe88d1b9805d203b4c5f10866b53b0463e20f46","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9cc5aa5c5894453b69b3fb4b2b98433eb92c51af766bc7c0687455753908fd2a","slc_aace86e5d4ee7a6d349efc0282389959df95816ed415fd1d10324c1821385b2e"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"The CLI includes commands such as hcom send, list, term, events --wait, kill, r (resume), f (fork), config, and a TUI dashboard launched by bare `hcom`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_37dd72edb7ff77fa16409f33278ef4fd2cc14c047786447fadf94987699568d3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_09598d7854a0ac0a360f7c62a303fc56e14f023aba5d5bbf197f6781aa11d27c","slc_a4ea67dc784aaed0701e9625e1aa563c5dbbebd793873019d9f5e3b7a9117866"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"hcom is a CLI that coding agents use to message, watch, and spawn each other across terminals, implemented as a single Rust binary with no background services.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_39a85315757091b8f90f96c0064af323f82b51da8494cf1c3e9c0bf113d54e5b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_56478d510938cf1eb36727ee512c9734cc42e8cc083003533d49e904f3e7b3bf","slc_e28ee9438e1ffd861800649962a6c6ce26c58c163cd5aa7bb7590b017959214e","slc_e817d6bc125982ee2d96282019bed143cf51e2ad4f1237591c353abca2edd674"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Repository development practice: building from source uses git clone, cargo build, and cargo test; local builds can be symlinked into ~/.cargo/bin or selected via the dev_root config.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"contextual_fact","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4146b20f4d3b8b612adbebad9cfcb6be6f99753dbfbce39a85929787c7711a8b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"code-inspected","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_01a77622071a1eba5aced2520df68e1d3151c2c4e5867e235fafb5dc5bf488e9","slc_0f61820580498479b25a8795037c310d3df0c770528ffb130b6001140fe3b44a","slc_638c6c8265788754d60677a92f891b3b7fc427f17ade2e7a40de2d26953de77d"],"source_ids":["src_29843589b61e55849a8ccbb29df449b5"],"text":"The relay command implementation parses --broker and --password flags, pings brokers over TCP/TLS, and derives relay health states (connected, starting, stale, waiting, error) from a shared RelayHealth type.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_46f8a2c8e41bc20322c3ccfc5636892e23d7e53a929fb431c4769d9dedaadbfe","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8a75f78fec52985c3e0588e7c5cc1bd7baf724472a70f334ee5a2c8de8c758a3","slc_c48a1c3cbd4ca0973ce954eb8b41e8c53e57b6d4e6bcd3d2204c8c211ab29af0","slc_d093c39839e54e29c8e1383a74934d494f5777c2ecd5806f7bfdeaa68a4940ff"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Configuration lives in ~/.hcom/config.toml with precedence defaults < config.toml < env vars, supports per-agent overrides via `hcom config -i`, and per-project isolation via HCOM_DIR.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_606018ccff73eb3a52b0f1ba6137b586272b2be150aa41c46f000666243f298e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c51cf6730d1000c7a964a6a582e8bf4dadebaaccb3237d470ca8c7dba1e40f51","slc_fd260dcf6eb4407313a072014625be74ce883d021e5f325e42fe56aeafaec4ed"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors build with cargo build && cargo test, set dev_root to run a local build, and run `just ci` as the local CI gate; the codebase is Rust.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_686ae608f1a1c6be186ec338a47ffb07e4bd0fade65f9f11d3b7a8437b6fe547","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_216ab46e79ccc2527696ddeda2ac4a63c3e306a84f86c75e74b7e4a25af1e4f8","slc_3ecabab7694874199e05426cb78f6447d18ac6adcf3dcc7e566d8a5c97f9ea51"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Launch flags include --tag, --terminal, --dir, --headless, --device (remote spawn via relay), --hcom-prompt, and --hcom-system-prompt; unknown flags are forwarded to the underlying tool.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"contextual_fact","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_852977b1e6615537e33b5cf81dca6d38365ce2fc233fc5f3e75cc80ed3ab156f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"code-inspected","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_513439a53e3734dde2a3f5641c400d57b04cc7be2a7ded1bdc0d236f07a4d522","slc_539d154dc1cfe57a94ffb3beb04b129c00844a144e3660f145f677c7a6d835ee","slc_74da5f28a34ec666069f0a422f9f926a0b017597847359cb21786dba86b0467d"],"source_ids":["src_29843589b61e55849a8ccbb29df449b5"],"text":"Join tokens encode relay_id and broker URL and always carry a PSK (v0x04); legacy PSK-less tokens are rejected by relay_connect, and status shows only a key fingerprint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_90f5959273c8f08623c1822137d41f6797100439a2dfa82863892e24afed75b9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3e3cb9c9f52bf27e39326690e84e7554b809b369868653a5a0a8dd4393a75e57","slc_9ac5882a11d7a1163d3d3494c3957d34a14c72ffb7e17c7eb61c33f000f5178d","slc_c3c513e5dd0f21a192c4c3ecc934e01ed1d196632c8c0f3f4f6a9e60e65ef914"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Cross-device sync uses an MQTT relay with subcommands such as new and connect; relay payloads are end-to-end encrypted with XChaCha20-Poly1305 under a shared PSK.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a598292ae6f0588a3badeba3360062180c7a314b8a22d51c6e1cb80a8ceb3230","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a0e8a6bd32b8531fbdbdf2c0af95378fb48d99888fcb55b08e4b3d40fe38afbf","slc_cb2eec4aceea4a669ff76d086b364f4d85dfea9f6b9575650fb0633245121c45"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Hooks record agent activity to a local SQLite database and deliver messages from it; messages arrive mid-turn between tool calls or wake idle agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b254f0f0bd9899f20d19f4027df8666b6fb02c289d076b9ff9c52061b15a82b0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d2489c7d329e9c9279e0c1d4e41a02a54dfec1c7cbfdc694e80014e32e46832","slc_dfe52a8399089d7550c2f9280373ce047ee88f6f9e29abac78afd9989aad80be"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Remote config_get/config_set refuse relay_psk, relay_token, relay_id, and the broker URL; the PSK is stored in config.toml with mode 0600 on Unix and kept out of environment variables.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dedda869c28e0ac87601917a6d13b92019398deef61d1ac0f2c33333d32e7a91","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_25ac0ea1cda8223c9b2c477a7c4cd068f31669533697072fc266ba1d3b076d70","slc_4740410985c9bf73f5bf1c4a4afe8cddee7090f7d7158b0108e722ef941475a8"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Hooks are installed into config dirs under ~/ (or HCOM_DIR) on first run, and hook-less AI tools can join by running `hcom start`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e8a450ba1698a7c2d19ff9764285c6a755c017e0d88f4991aea9b6edc1f0fb57","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cbbe7ad49180e1006da7df5a8dc8edb1bc065d01e917a45d05fa762fe0206fff"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Supported tools include Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex, Antigravity, OpenCode, Kilo Code, Pi, Oh My Pi, Cursor, Kimi, and Copilot with automatic message delivery; anything else connects manually via `hcom listen`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f4294712e12296364d70d2264aa6197b6079edadd658b4187cdabcebfb482a8e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_39396f377ac4057ffa1a38635afea88e85cc77b67a57cdbb8eb699f6c80afaa3","slc_54f6b373523bc39fb7d9a76a5ad35d1fe9016d7a73923b774bcdb702a77cdb4e","slc_f07faac42237ef194968f33cdb32e70a20fae372e2b8f6a3b24b764630ab8381"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"The relay is a single all-or-nothing trust domain with no scoped roles, read-only peers, or per-device permissions; a leaked PSK cannot be revoked and exposes old captured traffic (no forward secrecy).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f5029e14e0f2fc6bd0ee8a06f9db566f84d4a6cae870b5bf0a8fff3370926af6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"aannoo/hcom@fabb309b57cb snapshot 66e9c15eec3dd6cb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_20aab248c3505c0bd7a1d84bd1d1f623c03814ba02bd99b96ae3510ee00b27c3","slc_4a37f902492252a78222b5f5806d6bc3f7b2fef3b0a5730561f21625074d8788","slc_4d5bd16d0beaf3caa4d04f6ed9333a5955742ebecc738c0eeb6481f7f6ca56ff","slc_9c1713b87c11ee2fb6f0b58c9dbc377606586e03a7101c6542a37849770ba3f3","slc_cf36d901a8383ca5d214a0644febb17177f6bf5562a6c8ac252ddbaac067d1f8"],"source_ids":["src_ef241e95b3835eb7839c37b7e4cf6dda"],"text":"Install options include Homebrew (aannoo/hcom/hcom), pip/uv, a shell installer script, and a native PowerShell installer for Windows; `hcom update` upgrades an existing install.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3106447848a74cfe9170f7f6ce072cdf"}
